<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 32,500 MT were mainly the result of increases for Ecuador (20,500 MT) and Colombia (6,700 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 28,200 MT were three-quarters below the previous week and 57 percent less than the 4-week average. Colombia (8,300 MT), Canada (7,300 MT), and Guatemala (6,500 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
